。於是楚爲捍關以距之。十年，魏取我魯陽。十一年，肅王卒，無子，立其弟熊良夫，是爲宣王。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p062","quote":"宣王六年，周天子賀秦獻公。秦始復彊，而三晉益大，魏惠王、齊威王尤彊。三十年，秦封衞鞅於商，南侵楚。是年，宣王卒，子威王熊商立。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示立、是為及連續敘事暫接，未自動與其他篇候選合併；匿名身分、追稱與年代仍待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p061","text":"肅王四年，蜀伐楚，取茲方。於是楚爲捍關以距之。十年，魏取我魯陽。十一年，肅王卒，無子，立其弟熊良夫，是爲宣王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m061-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"肅王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001920","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m061-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"肅王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001920","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m061-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"熊良夫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001921","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m061-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001921","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p062","text":"宣王六年，周天子賀秦獻公。秦始復彊，而三晉益大，魏惠王、齊威王尤彊。三十年，秦封衞鞅於商，南侵楚。是年，宣王卒，子威王熊商立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m062-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001921","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m062-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"周天子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"賀秦獻公的周王未明姓名，待按版本與任時證據核對。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m062-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"秦獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002028","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m062-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"魏惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002029","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m062-0029","start":29,